Subject: [PATCH] A1: Table 3 parameters and Appendix B ledger, kernel-checked

Adds BGP212/Params.lean and BGP212/Ledger.lean (Table 3 and Table 6 as
exact rationals) and the Challenge/Solution pair AppendixB with eight
statements. table6_derivation ties every printed ledger entry to its
formula in the Table 3 parameters; it surfaced SI-3 (Proposition 7.8 (II)
states 9 epsilon, Table 6 row 14 prints the 15 epsilon value), recorded
in specs/A0_parameters.yaml.

